      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i'm also getting some pushback from some residents who are worried it's gonna ruin the \"character\" of the neighborhood and lead to more traffic and overcrowding. some people are calling it a NIMBY thing, but they seem pretty serious about it. how should i address those specific concerns in the presentation without sounding like i'm just dismissing them?",
